# Keep the build context small and keep secrets out of images
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
infra
deploy
**/*.log

# Environment files are never baked into an image; configuration comes from the task/container environment
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
